    "why": [
      "Saves 52% irrigation water (365 mm/yr \u2014 ~5 flood irrigations and 201 hrs/ha of 5-HP borewell pumping) vs. baseline [FAO-56]. Directly counters regional GRACE-FO terrestrial water storage decline of 4.2 cm/yr.",
      "Elevates Soil Health Score to 62/100 (+16 pts vs. baseline) and changes 10-year topsoil organic carbon by -0.2 t C/ha, saving 3.0 bags/ha of 45-kg Urea via biological N fixation [RothC-lite \u00b7 SoilGrids].",
      "Provides a 34-day Kharif-to-Rabi turnaround window for Happy Seeder / zero-till sowing with in-situ residue mulching \u2014 eliminating Oct\u2013Nov stubble burning monitored by NASA FIRMS.",
      "Timely sowing schedule buffers crops against 133 annual extreme heat days (>35\u00b0C) and 13.7 March\u2013April terminal grain-filling heat days (>32\u00b0C) recorded by NASA POWER.",
      "Delivers median net operating return of \u20b9149,335/ha (\u20b960,434/acre) with a worst-10% drought downside buffer (CVaR-10) of \u20b9139,057/ha (\u20b956,274/acre) [CACP MSP 2024-25]. Eligible schemes: Crop Diversification / Mera Pani Meri Virasat (\u20b917,500/ha state incentive); CRM Sub-Mission on Crop Residue Management (50\u201380% Happy Seeder / CHC subsidy)."
    ],
